<h1 data-copy-en="Lyra" data-copy-zh="Lyra">Lyra</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Lyra’s market schedule, supply-run route, Commerce reward and lantern-market date." data-copy-zh="Lyra的市场时间表、补给路线、商业奖励与灯笼集市约会。">Lyra’s market schedule, supply-run route, Commerce reward and lantern-market date.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Lyra</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Buying_Market_Supplies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Holiday_Antlers_Activity"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Four_Caravan_Defense_Contracts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Lantern_Market_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quiet_Stride"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Choice_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Friendship_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Market_Wisdom"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Talk_and_Flowers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Lyra — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lyra.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Lyra — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lyra.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Lyra — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Lyra is the merchant at the Medieval Village Market. Start with her introduction, then use conversation and flowers to reach the supply-run encounters, Commerce reward and two personal heart-to-hearts. The evening date follows those conversations.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Where_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>Where to find Lyra</h2><p>Go to Medieval → Village Outskirts → Village Market. She is present daily, 06:00–21:00. Automatic scenes have their own narrower start windows, shown below.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Village Market</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Market_Routes"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Finish A Fair Introduction. For the joint supply run, complete Gem’s mining lesson, reach Gem Friend (100) and Lyra Known (25), then return to the market 07:00–17:00. This is the prerequisite for Market Routes; merely reaching Friend is insufficient.</p><p>After Market Routes, reach Crush (400) and return 18:00–21:00 for Quiet Stride. At Romantic (800), the one-time Lantern Market becomes available in that same evening window.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Specialized Care</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Village Healer's Hut; 08:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Amelia Acknowledged (10); Lyra Friend (100); after The Healer's Hut; not vacationing: Lyra</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Lyra +5 / Amelia +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Crimson Bull</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Village Market; 08:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Lyra Friend (100); not vacationing: Lyra</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Lyra +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Fair Introduction</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Village Market; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Lyra +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Caravan Defense</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Caravan Rest Stop; 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">active Fighters Guild contract 4</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Lyra +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Caravan Defense II</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Caravan Rest Stop; 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">active Fighters Guild contract 9</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Lyra +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Caravan Defense III</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Caravan Rest Stop; 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">active Fighters Guild contract 14</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Lyra +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Caravan Defense IV</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Caravan Rest Stop; 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">active Fighters Guild contract 19</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Lyra +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Short Legs, Long Road</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Village Market; 07:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Gem Friend (100); Lyra Known (25); after The Dwarven Way</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Gem +10 / Lyra +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The High Road</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Mountain Foothills; 07:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Gem Friend (100); Lyra Friend (100); after Short Legs, Long Road</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Gem +12 / Lyra +12</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Market Routes</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Village Market; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Short Legs, Long Road</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −15 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Quiet Stride</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Village Market; 18:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after Market Routes</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −15 Energy; +18 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lantern Market</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Village Market; 18:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); after Quiet Stride</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $70; −30 Energy; +18 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Alehouse_Performance_Reaction"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Talk gives 1 base relationship point, up to five safe uses daily. Flowers give 5 base points per use, up to three daily; each consumes one Flowers. Market Wisdom grants Commerce +1 and 8 direct relationship points once.</p><p>The shared care encounter starts at Amelia’s hut, not Lyra’s stall. Fighters Guild caravan contracts are separate nighttime assignments at the Caravan Rest Stop; use the guild guide for acceptance and combat preparation.</p><p>Listed relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers can change the final gain. Daily allowances for the same action follow the character across locations; starting it elsewhere does not create a fresh allowance.</p><details><summary>Relationship bonuses</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Favorite stats</th><td data-label="Reference">Intelligence 45 / Commerce 40 / Ability 45</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship skill</th><td data-label="Reference">Animal Care</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Favorite-stat contribution scales toward the listed values. The relationship skill affects the shared relationship multiplier; it is not automatically a skill taught by this character.</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Lyra</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Village Market; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 5 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Flowers</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Village Market; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +5; 3 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Market Wisdom</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Village Market; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Communication 42</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">Commerce +1; direct relationship +8; once</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>Heart-to-heart reward reference</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Conversation</th><th scope="col">Best ordinary base total</th><th scope="col">Useful special replies</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Market Routes</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">31</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">round 1: Intelligence 45 (+1 base)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Quiet Stride</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">37</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">round 1: Empathy (+1 base)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>These totals describe the best ordinary choices, before relationship modifiers. A special reply can improve the reward; it is not required just to finish the conversation. Romantic adds 25 final relationship points on completion.</p></details></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>If Market Routes is missing, check the completed supply-run encounter as well as Friend. Quiet Stride and the date require an evening start. Flowers, Talk and the one-time Commerce reward have separate limits.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a> · <a href="game-systems-fighters-guild.html">Fighters Guild</a> · <a href="character-gem.html">Gem</a> · <a href="character-amelia.html">Amelia</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Buying_Market_Supplies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Holiday_Antlers_Activity"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Four_Caravan_Defense_Contracts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Lantern_Market_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quiet_Stride"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Choice_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Friendship_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Market_Wisdom"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Talk_and_Flowers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Lyra 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lyra.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Lyra 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lyra.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Lyra 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Lyra在中世纪的村庄市场经营生意。初次见面后，可以靠交谈与送花提升关系，再推进补给途中发生的事件、商业奖励和两段个人谈心；晚间约会接在谈心之后。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Where_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>前往中世纪 → 村庄外围 → 村庄市场。她每天06:00—21:00在场；自动事件还有各自更窄的触发时段，见下表。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">村庄市场</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Market_Routes"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先完成公平交易，友好相识。补给事件要求完成Gem的采矿教学、Gem达到朋友（100）、Lyra达到已知（25），再于07:00—17:00回到市场。这是市场路线的前置，单有朋友关系还不够。</p><p>完成市场路线后，将关系提升到迷恋（400），于18:00—21:00选择静步。达到浪漫感（800）后，同一晚间时段开放一次性的灯笼集市。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">特别的诊治</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">村庄治疗师小屋; 08:00–19:00</td><td data-label="条件">Amelia 已遇见（10）；Lyra 朋友（100）；完成：治疗师的小屋；未在度假：Lyra</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Lyra +5、Amelia +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">赤红公牛</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">村庄市场; 08:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">Lyra 朋友（100）；未在度假：Lyra</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Lyra +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">公平交易，友好相识</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">村庄市场; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Lyra +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">商队护卫</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">商队休息站; 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">正在进行战士公会第4份委托</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Lyra +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">商队护卫 II</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">商队休息站; 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">正在进行战士公会第9份委托</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Lyra +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">商队护卫 III</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">商队休息站; 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">正在进行战士公会第14份委托</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Lyra +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">商队护卫 IV</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">商队休息站; 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">正在进行战士公会第19份委托</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Lyra +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">腿短，路长</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">村庄市场; 07:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">Gem 朋友（100）；Lyra 已知（25）；完成：矮人之道</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Gem +10、Lyra +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">高路</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">山脚; 07:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Gem 朋友（100）；Lyra 朋友（100）；完成：腿短，路长</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Gem +12、Lyra +12</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">市场路线</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">村庄市场; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：腿短，路长</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75分钟；−15 精力；+10 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">静步</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">村庄市场; 18:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：市场路线</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90分钟；−15 精力；+18 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">灯笼集市</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">村庄市场; 18:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）；完成：静步</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富70；−30 精力；+18 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Alehouse_Performance_Reaction"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>交谈每次获得1点基础关系，每日安全额度5次；送花每次获得5点基础关系，每日3次，每次消耗一份鲜花。市场智慧一次性给予商业+1及8点直接关系。</p><p>共同诊治事件在Amelia的小屋触发，不在Lyra的摊位。战士公会的商队任务则是在商队休息站进行的夜间委托，接取方法与战斗准备见公会指南。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，所列关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量会受共通关系修正影响。同一动作的每日额度跟随角色计算，换地点不会获得新额度。</p><details><summary>展开关系加成参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">参考</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">偏好属性</th><td data-label="参考">智力 45、商业 40、能力 45</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系加成技能</th><td data-label="参考">动物照料</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>偏好属性的加成随数值提高，逐步达到所列参考值。关系加成技能影响共通关系倍率，不代表该角色一定负责教授这项技能。</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Lyra 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">村庄市场; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；5次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送花</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">村庄市场; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+5；3次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">市场智慧</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">村庄市场; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；沟通42</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">商业 +1；直接关系+8；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>展开谈心奖励参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">谈心</th><th scope="col">最佳普通选择基础总值</th><th scope="col">实用特殊回复条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">市场路线</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">31</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">第1轮: 智力 45（+1基础点）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">静步</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">37</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">第1轮: 共情（+1基础点）</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>总值为普通选项的最佳基础合计，尚未套用关系修正。特殊回复可提高奖励，但不是完成谈心的必要条件；学会浪漫后，完成时另加25点最终关系。</p></details></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>缺少市场路线时，除了检查朋友关系，还要确认补给事件确实完成。静步和集市约会需要在晚间开始。送花、交谈和一次性的商业奖励各自计算次数。</p></section>
